  "knowledge": {
    "progressSummary": "Created AmgmInequalityOQ02OQ01OQ05OQ01.lean (5 theorems, 3 defs, 0 sorries, 0 axioms, 155 lines, Docker build green 7743 jobs on Mathlib v4.26.0). COMPLEMENTARY result: the general-n all-k Newton log-concavity is already proven for nonnegative reals in AmgmInequalityOQ02OQ02.lean (elemSymm_log_concave / newton_log_concavity_proved). This entry adds, for n=3: (a) a SIGN-AGNOSTIC proof of e2^2>=3*e1*e3 (all reals, no nonnegativity), (b) the explicit SOS certificate e2^2-3e1e3 = 1/2[(ab-bc)^2+(bc-ca)^2+(ca-ab)^2], (c) the equality characterization ab=bc=ca. Gallery entry status verified/badge verified.",
    "builtItems": [
      "newton_sos_identity: e2^2 - 3e1e3 = 1/2[(ab-bc)^2 + (bc-ca)^2 + (ca-ab)^2] (pure ring identity)",
      "newton_cleared: e2^2 >= 3*e1*e3 for ALL reals (nlinarith on the SOS certificate; no nonnegativity)",
      "newton_base_step: averaged form S2^2 >= S1*S3 with S1=e1/3, S2=e2/3, S3=e3 (div_nonneg reduction)",
      "newton_eq_of_all_eq: a=b=c => e2^2 = 3e1e3 (equality forward)",
      "newton_products_eq_of_eq: e2^2 = 3e1e3 => ab=bc=ca (equality converse via pow_eq_zero_iff)"
    ],
    "insights": [
      "DEDUP CHECK: general-n all-k Newton log-concavity is ALREADY in the gallery (amgm-inequality-oq-02-oq-02, AmgmInequalityOQ02OQ02.lean) for nonnegative reals. This entry is complementary, not a first proof.",
      "The genuine delta at n=3 is dropping nonnegativity: the SOS certificate is sign-agnostic, so e2^2>=3e1e3 holds for all reals, whereas elemSymm_log_concave assumes hx: 0<=x i.",
      "At n=3 Newton's k=2 inequality is literally a three-term sum of squares, discharged by ring+nlinarith with no induction and no Rolle/discriminant machinery.",
      "Equality locus is exactly ab=bc=ca (=> a=b=c for nonzero vars), read off the vanishing certificate.",
      "Forward frontier: the SIGN-AGNOSTIC general-n form 2(n-2)e2^2 >= 3(n-1)e1e3 (all reals) is still open; needs Rolle's theorem or a general SOS witness."
    ],
